</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="sec"><div class="sn">4 · Guardrails</div><h2>Must never be flattened · what it is NOT</h2><div class="two"><div><div class="sn" style="color:var(--red)">Must never be flattened</div><ul class="plain"><li>ICP specificity as a deliberate targeting decision</li><li>Never weaken it into a generic persona form</li><li>The ICP object is central and authored, not a form output</li></ul></div><div><div class="sn" style="color:var(--ink-3)">What it is NOT</div><ul class="plain"><li>Not a persona template</li><li>Not a worksheet</li><li>Not a demographics form</li><li>Not a “build your buyer” wizard</li></ul></div></div></div>
