+  <div class="mast"><div class="k">Cold Call Studio · execution workflow · capability map</div><h1>Prepare the call and record the outcome.</h1><div class="fam">execution workflow (live execution) · settled 2026-07-06 (the game plan · prep-before / log-after)</div><p>Cold Call Studio supports preparation before a call and outcome capture afterward. Preserve the six-step call plan and its buyer-response branches.</p><div class="src">Sourced from: canon §4.9 (no-live-call-operation, 2026-07-04) + shipped src/cold-call-studio. Settled design: cold-call-studio-gameplan-2026-07-06.html.</div></div>
