-  <div class="mast"><div class="k">LinkedIn Playbook · Live Instrument · capability map</div><h1>LinkedIn as disciplined air cover — never the opening scene.</h1><div class="fam">Live Instrument (live execution) · settled 2026-07-06 (the one move)</div><p>Use LinkedIn as disciplined air cover — never the opening scene. Public cue first, ask only when trust has compounded. The inbox is not where you start: the five cues run <b>watch public signal → comment with one operating read → connect after recognition → give-first → ask only when it’s warranted</b>.</p><div class="src">Sourced from: canon §4.10 + the motion engine + 5-cue ladder (shipped src/linkedin-playbook). Settled design: linkedin-playbook-one-move-2026-07-06.html.</div></div>
