lows in</div><ul class="plain"><li>account + persona from <b>Signal Console</b> / <b>Outbound Studio</b></li></ul></div><div class="flowcol out"><div class="fh">Flows out</div><ul class="plain"><li>motion truth → <b>Dashboard</b> · <b>Signal Console</b> · <b>Readiness</b> · <b>Handoff</b></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="sec"><div class="sn">5 · Guardrails</div><h2>Must never be flattened · what it is NOT</h2><div class="two"><div><div class="sn" style="color:var(--red)">Must never be flattened</div><ul class="plain"><li>Channel-specific discipline (public cue first, ask last)</li><li>The one move at a time</li></ul></div><div><div class="sn" style="color:var(--ink-3)">What it is NOT</div><ul class="plain"><li>Never generic outreach tips</li><li>Not an inbox-first outreach tool</li><li>Not a connection-request blaster</li><li>Not a content scheduler</li></ul></div></div></div>
