ok</b> · <b>Readiness</b> · <b>sales handoff documentation</b></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="sec"><div class="sn">4 · Guardrails</div><h2>Must never be flattened · what it is NOT</h2><div class="two"><div><div class="sn" style="color:var(--red)">Must never be flattened</div><ul class="plain"><li>Specific, evidence-based messages and responsible outreach</li><li>No send path without a named strain</li><li>The recovery cable on every route</li></ul></div><div><div class="sn" style="color:var(--ink-3)">What it is NOT</div><ul class="plain"><li>Never a template-spam generator</li><li>Not a mail-merge tool</li><li>Not a sequence blaster</li><li>Not a generic copy generator</li></ul></div></div></div>
