<li>section-readiness count from <b>Founding GTM</b> (drives the repeatable gate)</li></ul></div><div class="flowcol out"><div class="fh">Flows out</div><ul class="plain"><li>verdict + topbar anchor into the <b>Dashboard</b></li><li>a verdict transition <b>UP</b> triggers the visual transition in <b>Founding GTM</b></li><li>verdict + gating evidence into the <b>Welcome</b> read</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="sec"><div class="sn">5 · Language — plain, no scoring vocabulary</div><h2>Scrubbed on the face</h2><div class="sd">The shipped Phase-5.A drawer leaked internal scoring language + retired nouns — all scrubbed.</div><table data-copy-context="deprecated-example"><tr><th style="width:230px">Banned on the face</th><th>Say instead</th></tr><tr><td>“proof”</td><td><b>pilot evidence</b></td></tr><tr><td>“sanity-check”</td><td><b>with you there to answer questions</b></td></tr><tr><td>naked “dimension”</td><td>name the actual <b>part of the motion</b> (your targeting / outreach / discovery / open deals / pilot evidence)</td></tr><tr><td>“/20” or a bare score</td><td>the <b>state</b> — never a number</td></tr><tr><td>“verdict” (courtroom sense)</td><td>stays internal engine name only; the face names the state itself</td></tr></table></div><div class="sec"><div class="sn">6 · Guardrails</div><h2>Must never be flattened · what it is NOT</h2><div class="two"><div><div class="sn" style="color:var(--red)">Must never be flattened</div><ul class="plain"><li>Verdict as gate-based truth (not threshold-based)</li><li>The central question: can another seller run the process?</li><li>The ceremony at verdict transitions UP</li><li>Readiness progression based on accumulated evidence</li></ul></div><div><div class="sn" style="color:var(--ink-3)">What it is NOT</div><ul class="plain"><li>Never duplicate what the Dashboard says about “what’s weakest now”</li><li>Never a 5-bar score breakdown as the primary surface</li><li>Not a ranking of today’s urgent actions</li><li>Bars are de